<span class="tk-tag">&lt;dialog</span> <span class="tk-attr">id</span>=<span class="tk-str">"sc-process"</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-component</span>=<span class="tk-str">"modal"</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"max-w-2xl rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10"</span> <span class="tk-attr">aria-labelledby</span>=<span class="tk-str">"sc-process-title"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>
  <span class="tk-tag">&lt;h2</span> <span class="tk-attr">id</span>=<span class="tk-str">"sc-process-title"</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"font-heading text-2xl font-bold"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>From draft to live<span class="tk-tag">&lt;/h2</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>
  <span class="tk-tag">&lt;ol</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"mt-6 list-none space-y-4 p-0"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>
    <span class="tk-tag">&lt;li</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"flex gap-4"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span><span class="tk-tag">&lt;span</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"grid h-8 w-8 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 font-bold ws-ink"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>1<span class="tk-tag">&lt;/span</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span><span class="tk-tag">&lt;span</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"text-base-content/80"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>Edit the page and check it in the live preview.<span class="tk-tag">&lt;/span</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span><span class="tk-tag">&lt;/li</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>
    <span class="tk-tag">&lt;li</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"flex gap-4"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span><span class="tk-tag">&lt;span</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"grid h-8 w-8 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 font-bold ws-ink"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>2<span class="tk-tag">&lt;/span</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span><span class="tk-tag">&lt;span</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"text-base-content/80"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>Share the preview with a link that expires on its own.<span class="tk-tag">&lt;/span</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span><span class="tk-tag">&lt;/li</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>
    <span class="tk-tag">&lt;li</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"flex gap-4"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span><span class="tk-tag">&lt;span</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"grid h-8 w-8 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 font-bold ws-ink"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>3<span class="tk-tag">&lt;/span</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span><span class="tk-tag">&lt;span</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"text-base-content/80"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>Deploy. Only the files that changed are uploaded.<span class="tk-tag">&lt;/span</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span><span class="tk-tag">&lt;/li</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>
  <span class="tk-tag">&lt;/ol</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>
<span class="tk-tag">&lt;/dialog</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span></code></pre>
</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-start">
    <div data-sw-animation="fade-up">
      <p class="ws-index ws-ink">03 · A forced choice</p>
      <h2 class="ws-display mt-3 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-5xl" data-sw-text="m3_title">Only your buttons close it.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-base-content/70" data-sw-text="m3_lead"><code class="font-code text-base">data-sw-modal</code> opens a dialog from a button. This one drops the corner button and ignores backdrop clicks, so the visitor has to choose. Any element marked <code class="font-code text-base">data-sw-part="close"</code> closes it.</p>
      <div class="mt-8">

<button type="button" class="btn" data-sw-modal="sc-confirm">Reset the demo</button>
<dialog id="sc-confirm" data-sw-component="modal" data-closebutton="false" data-backdrop-close="false" aria-labelledby="sc-confirm-title">
  <h2 id="sc-confirm-title" class="font-heading text-xl font-bold">Reset the demo?</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 text-base-content/70">Nothing is reset. This dialog only shows the pattern.</p>
  <div class="mt-6 flex justify-end gap-2">
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost" data-sw-part="close">Cancel</button>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-sw-part="close">Reset</button>
  </div>
</dialog>

      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="min-w-0">
<div class="ws-window overflow-hidden rounded-2xl">
  <div class="ws-dots flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-3"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="ml-3 font-code text-xs text-white/50">modal · forced choice</span></div>
<pre class="overflow-x-auto"><code><span class="tk-tag">&lt;button</span> <span class="tk-attr">type</span>=<span class="tk-str">"button"</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"btn"</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-modal</span>=<span class="tk-str">"sc-confirm"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>Reset the demo<span class="tk-tag">&lt;/button</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>
<span class="tk-tag">&lt;dialog</span> <span class="tk-attr">id</span>=<span class="tk-str">"sc-confirm"</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-component</span>=<span class="tk-str">"modal"</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-closebutton</span>=<span class="tk-str">"false"</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-backdrop-close</span>=<span class="tk-str">"false"</span> <span class="tk-attr">aria-labelledby</span>=<span class="tk-str">"sc-confirm-title"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>
  <span class="tk-tag">&lt;h2</span> <span class="tk-attr">id</span>=<span class="tk-str">"sc-confirm-title"</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"font-heading text-xl font-bold"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>Reset the demo?<span class="tk-tag">&lt;/h2</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>
  <span class="tk-tag">&lt;p</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"mt-3 text-base-content/70"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>Nothing is reset. This dialog only shows the pattern.<span class="tk-tag">&lt;/p</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>
  <span class="tk-tag">&lt;div</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"mt-6 flex justify-end gap-2"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>
    <span class="tk-tag">&lt;button</span> <span class="tk-attr">type</span>=<span class="tk-str">"button"</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"btn btn-ghost"</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-part</span>=<span class="tk-str">"close"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>Cancel<span class="tk-tag">&lt;/button</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>
    <span class="tk-tag">&lt;button</span> <span class="tk-attr">type</span>=<span class="tk-str">"button"</span> <span class="tk-attr">class</span>=<span class="tk-str">"btn btn-primary"</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-part</span>=<span class="tk-str">"close"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>Reset<span class="tk-tag">&lt;/button</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>
  <span class="tk-tag">&lt;/div</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>
<span class="tk-tag">&lt;/dialog</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span></code></pre>
